    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_i_shared_checkpoint_store" kindref="compound">ISharedCheckpointStore</ref></computeroutput> backed by a mutex-protected in-memory map. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Suitable for single-process multi-worker deployments (e.g. tests and the default <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_in_process_worker_node" kindref="compound">InProcessWorkerNode</ref></computeroutput> mode). Production deployments inject a Redis- or database-backed implementation via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_coordinator_1a793dc18b226e4b0c2a8ef1263502b503" kindref="member">IngestionCoordinator::setSharedCheckpointStoreForTesting()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: fully thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
